#: ../../source/interoperability.rst:6
msgid "Interoperability"
msgstr "互操作性"

#: ../../source/interoperability.rst:11
msgid "Machine Representation"
msgstr "机器表示"

#: ../../source/interoperability.rst:13
msgid ""
"cuTile executes Python |tile code| on NVIDIA GPUs by translating the "
"Python code into a *machine representation* that can be executed by CUDA "
"devices. Functions, types, and objects all have a machine representation."
msgstr ""
"cuTile 通过将 Python |tile code| 翻译为可由 CUDA 设备执行的 *机器表示* （machine "
"representation），从而在 NVIDIA GPU 上执行它们。函数、类型和对象均具有各自的机器表示。"

#: ../../source/interoperability.rst:16
msgid ""
"Machine representations are defined in terms of corresponding CUDA C++ "
"entities. Example: ``cuda.tile.float16`` has the same machine "
"representation as ``__half`` in CUDA C++."
msgstr ""
"机器表示依据对应的 CUDA C++ 实体来定义。例如： ``cuda.tile.float16`` 与 CUDA C++ 中的 "
"``__half`` 具有相同的机器表示。"

#: ../../source/interoperability.rst:21
msgid "Interoperability with SIMT"
msgstr "与 SIMT 的互操作性"

#: ../../source/interoperability.rst:24
msgid "Inter-Kernel"
msgstr "跨内核互操作"

#: ../../source/interoperability.rst:26
msgid ""
"Inter-kernel interoperability refers to all interoperability concerns "
"that do not cross the kernel boundary - everything except mixing tile and"
" SIMT code in a kernel. This includes:"
msgstr "跨内核互操作性指所有不跨越单个内核边界的互操作场景——即除在同一内核内混用 Tile 与 SIMT 代码之外的所有情况。这包括："

#: ../../source/interoperability.rst:29
msgid "Writing tile and SIMT kernels in the same source file."
msgstr "在同一个源文件中编写 Tile 内核和 SIMT 内核。"

#: ../../source/interoperability.rst:30
msgid "Linking tile and SIMT kernels into the same binary."
msgstr "将 Tile 内核与 SIMT 内核链接到同一个二进制文件中。"

#: ../../source/interoperability.rst:31
msgid "Passing the same kinds of arrays to both tile and SIMT kernels."
msgstr "向 Tile 内核和 SIMT 内核传递相同类型的数组。"

#: ../../source/interoperability.rst:33
msgid "Intra-kernel interoperability will be supported in the future."
msgstr "内核内部（Intra-kernel）互操作性将在未来版本中提供支持。"

#: ../../source/interoperability.rst:37
msgid "JAX FFI"
msgstr "JAX FFI"

#: ../../source/interoperability.rst:39
msgid ""
"cuTile kernels can be launched from JAX-traced graphs via "
":func:`cuda.tile.jax.cutile_call`, which threads buffers, scalar, and "
"tuple arguments through the JAX FFI call site so the kernel runs as a "
"regular op inside a ``jax.jit``\\-compiled graph."
msgstr ""
"cuTile 内核可以通过 :func:`cuda.tile.jax.cutile_call` 从 JAX 追踪计算图中启动。该函数通过 JAX "
"FFI 调用点传递缓冲区、标量和元组参数，使内核能够作为常规算子在 ``jax.jit`` 编译的图中运行。"

#: ../../source/interoperability.rst:44
msgid ""
"See :func:`cuda.tile.jax.cutile_call` for the full argument convention, "
"along with :class:`cuda.tile.jax.OutputPlaceholder` and "
":class:`cuda.tile.jax.InputOutput` for declaring outputs and in-place "
"updates."
msgstr ""
"完整参数约定请参见 :func:`cuda.tile.jax.cutile_call` ，有关声明输出和原地更新的用法，请参见 "
":class:`cuda.tile.jax.OutputPlaceholder` 和 "
":class:`cuda.tile.jax.InputOutput` 。"

